  "name": "Deferit App - Enhanced Testofill Configuration",
  "notes": [
    "File upload fields cannot be auto-filled and require manual selection",
    "Some fields may appear conditionally based on country (AU vs US)",
    "SSN field only appears for US users",
    "Payment forms use iframes which require special handling with iframeFields",
    "Verification codes are the last 6 digits of the phone number",
    "Emails use @tfbnw.net domain with test_{firstName}.{lastName}.t{time} pattern for uniqueness",
    "Use {time} placeholder in email fields for human-readable dynamic generation",
    "Use {firstName} placeholder for random first name generation",
    "Use {random4} placeholder for unique 4-digit SSN suffixes",
